{"suttaId":"tha-ap462","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1277,1297],"vripara":"63"},"segments":{"tha-ap462:0.3":"Gandhapūjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap462:1.1":"“Citāsu kurumānāsu [cittesu kayiramānesu (sī.)], nānāgandhe samāhaṭe;","tha-ap462:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, gandhamuṭṭhimapūjayiṃ.","tha-ap462:2.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, citakaṃ yamapūjayiṃ;","tha-ap462:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, citapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap462:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap462:4.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap462:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap462:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā gandhapūjako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap462:7.1":"Gandhapūjakattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap462:8.1":"Jagatidāyakavaggo chacattālīsamo.","tha-ap462:9.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap462:10.1":"Jagatī morahatthī ca, āsanī ukkadhārako;","tha-ap462:10.3":"Akkami vanakoraṇḍi, chattado jātipūjako.","tha-ap462:11.1":"Paṭṭipupphī ca yo thero, dasamo gandhapūjako;","tha-ap462:11.3":"Sattasaṭṭhi ca gāthāyo, gaṇitāyo vibhāvibhi."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
